[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_bib0o")
name = "I"
img = ExtResource("1_xver5")
info = "[center]
When i was thinking of how to design the gear item that the character Bessa gave the player, this was what came to mind.
Well not exactly, the general idea was it shaped like a gear...that's it but i started looking at steampunk references on Pinterest and got the idea of putting a core right at the center to make it look less bland and more of having a practical use, the first draft didn't look like a gear at all so i tore the paper and started another.
The purpose of the design is showcase that the world is actually advancing in tech...in a way, magical based tech to be specific and my main inspiration for that will and always will be Final Fantasy VI (MagiTech) 
[/center]"
